posts.body:
As a quick solution, edit goCounterSkill in the plugin that was linked:
Code:
function goCounterSkill(subject, target, skillId) {
    // 戦闘行動の強制を実行
    const counterOk = subject.counterForceAction(skillId, target);
    // 不発の場合は終了
    if (!counterOk) {
        return;
    }
    // begin edit: display the counter attack message
    const text = TextManager.counterAttack.format(subject.name());
    BattleManager._logWindow.push("addText", text);
    // end edit
    // カウンター実行フラグオン
    mInCounter = true;
    BattleManager._actionForcedBattler = subject;
    BattleManager.processForcedAction();
    // 【ＭＶ】強制実行フラグを解除
    // ※強制フラグが立っていると、ステートのターン経過が行われないため。
    if (BattleManager.isForcedTurn && BattleManager.isForcedTurn()) {
        BattleManager._turnForced = false;
    }
}
Not seeing a nicer way to patch/alias from the quick look I took.
